<title>USA: Developers Diversified Realty Q4 FFO rises.</title>
<headline>Developers Diversified Realty Q4 FFO rises.</headline>
<dateline>CLEVELAND 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.40		    $0.38</p>
<p> Net			 12,296		    8,387</p>
<p> Revs			33,832		   28,987</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  21,642		   18,965</p>
<p>	  12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			  $1.67		    $1.29</p>
<p> Net			 49,542		   25,505</p>
<p> Revs		     130,906		  107,805</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  21,142		   18,780</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE - Q4 1996 funds from operations were $16.56 million, or $0.77 per share, versus $13.25 million, or $0.70 per share.</p>
<p>For the 1996 fiscal year, funds from operations were $64.64 million, or $3.06 per share, versus $50.09 million, or $2.67 per share.</p>
<p>Full company name is Developers Diversified Realty Corp</p>
